   "id": "q_haarama_egoz",
   "gloss_en": "may a woman use artifice, fastening on a nut to carry it out to her young son on Shabbat? Asked on both views: even for the one who permits artifice at a fire -- there, he would otherwise come to extinguish, but here, if not permitted, she will not come to carry out; or perhaps even for the one who forbids it -- there, that is the way of carrying out, but here it is not, so say it is fine. Unresolved",
